base url:    http://SERVER
reachable:   yes
ready:       yes
cdp:         enabled
key:         valid (from file)
mcp:         needs $SPICRAWL_API_KEY, which is not set here: Claude Code
workers:
  browser    3 ready of 3
  egress     1 ready of 1
  batch      2 ready of 2
repairs:
  - check: mcp
    command: spicrawl init --client claude --yes --force
    unattended_safe: true
    why: Claude Code read the key from $SPICRAWL_API_KEY, which is not set here, so the MCP server cannot authenticate; this rewrites the entry with the key saved in the CLI config (the old file is kept as .bak)
